<!-- Compliance -->
<section class="section bg-surface">
  <div class="container-narrow mx-auto px-4 text-center">
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto">All products are manufactured for <strong>laboratory research purposes only</strong>. Ipamorelin is labeled FOR LABORATORY RESEARCH USE ONLY. Not for human or veterinary diagnostic/therapeutic/prophylactic use. Not a dietary supplement, pharmaceutical ingredient, or approved drug substance.</p>
